<title>BRAZIL: Telebras Jan-Aug net.</title>
<headline>Telebras Jan-Aug net.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's state-controlled telecommunications holding Telebras announced the following results for the January-August period.</p>
<p>			 Jan-Aug 1996	     Jan-Aug 1995</p>
<p>Consolidated net	1.803 billion reais   n/a</p>
<p>Revenues		 10.769 billion reais   n/a</p>
<p>Net per 1,000 shrs   n/a			  n/a</p>
<p>Note: Telebras said its results were preliminary and had not been audited.</p>
<p>Net profit of the holding company during the January-August period was 2.172 billion reais.</p>
<p>Net operational revenues totalled 8.170 billion reais during the period.</p>
<p>The number of installed lines rose to 14.05 million by August from 13.31 million in December 1995.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia Newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
</text>
